## Port of pumpkin/src/entity/player.rs: `set_experience`, `set_experience_level`, `add_experience_levels`,
## `set_experience_points`, `add_experience_points` and `apply_mending_from_xp` (entity/playerextras.aowl keeps `tick_experience`).
## Kept apart from playerextras.aowl, whose `newCSoundEffect` call stops type-checking beside these imports.

{.feature: "untyped".}
{.feature: "lenientnils".}

import std/[options, tables]
import ../../generated/enchantment
import ../../protocol/java/client/play/set_player_inventory
import ../../protocol/itemstackserializer
import ../../protocol/varint
import ../../util/math/experience
